			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Blaze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does increased instant Heat damage to the target </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Burning Radiance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that has a chance to grant the target group member additional over-time Heat damage on a successful attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Vivid Seal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Intelligence and Strength, and grants Heat mitigation to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Painful Meditation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Converts health to power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.2 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Freezing Whorl </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Does over-time Cold damage and decreases Elemental mitigations to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer/Enchanter/Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lightning Surge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ice Spike </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Freeze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals cold damage and stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Tongue Twist </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Interupts the targets casting and stiffles them. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Incinerate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals fire damage over time and reduces the target and its allies stamina &amp; agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Summon Shadows </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants a single target invisibility with movement rate reductions. Can only be cast on one player at a time and it is broken if any group member enters combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Accord </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Augmentation that has a chance to replenish Power over-time whenever the target group member is successfully attacked. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Frozen Manacles </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage and roots the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Chilling Wind </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Does Cold damage over-time and decreases Elemental mitigation on the target and surrounding encounter members within the area of effect. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">T Lys Minor Familiar </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Familiar. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Breath of the Tyrant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals heat damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lightning Flash </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals an area of effect mental damage and has a chance to do additional heat damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ball of Fire </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Does instant Heat damage to the target opponent. (Shares re-use with Mage: Lightning spell line) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Snow Filled Steepes </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants invisibility and elemental mitigation to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Amplification </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups intelligence, strength, and heat mitication. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Boreal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mezs the target. Immobilizes the caster and drains the casters power over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Dazzling Seal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the groups intelligence, strength, and heat mitigation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Flametongue </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants the targets weapon a chance to proc for heat damage over time and increases the targets heat mitigation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blazing Intimidation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals heat damage and stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Plasmatic Pulse </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals heat damage and has a chance to do additional magic damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Essence Harvest </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Power instantly but stuns the caster for a period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Pyre </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals an area of effect heat damage and has a chance to reduce the stamina of all targets hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Icy Coil </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage over time and reduces the targets elemental mitigation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Wizard </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textu